# 17. Core Comprehension Patterns

### List

```python
[value for item in collection]
```

### List + condition

```python
[value for item in collection if condition]
```

### Dictionary

```python
{key: value for item in collection}
```

### Dictionary + condition

```python
{key: value for item in collection if condition}
```

### Dictionary + conditional value

```python
{
    key: value_if_true if condition else value_if_false
    for item in collection
}
```

---

# 18. Key Mental Model

When you see:

```python
[
    expression
    for item in collection
    if condition
]
```

read it as:

> "For every item in this collection, if the condition is true, create this expression and put it into a list."

When you see:

```python
{
    key: value
    for item in collection
    if condition
}
```

read it as:

> "For every item in this collection, if the condition is true, create this key-value pair and put it into a dictionary."

